msgid "A listing is only offered escrow if its currency code is one of these. Osclass stores a currency code as exactly 3 letters, so \"ELEK\" itself can never be one; use a 3-letter contraction such as ELE or ELK instead."
msgstr "A listing is only offered escrow if its currency code is one of these. Osclass stores a currency code as exactly 3 letters, so \"ELEK\" itself can never be one; use a 3-letter contraction such as ELE or ELK instead."

msgid "Accepted currency codes (one per line)"
msgstr "Accepted currency codes (one per line)"

