msgstr "Check payment"

msgid "Order marked as released."
msgstr "Order marked as released."

msgid "This plugin cannot yet build or relay the release transaction itself; the two parties currently have to cooperatively sign and broadcast it using their own wallets, with the redeem script below."
msgstr "This plugin cannot yet build or relay the release transaction itself; the two parties currently have to cooperatively sign and broadcast it using their own wallets, with the redeem script below."

msgid "Mark this order as released? Only do this once the funds have actually been sent to your own wallet."
msgstr "Mark this order as released? Only do this once the funds have actually been sent to your own wallet."

